{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2023-04-19 04:09:00', 'title': 'PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL RELEASES FIRST TCFD REPORT, RECOGNIZED AS SUPPLIER ENGAGEMENT LEADER BY CDP', 'text': 'LAUSANNE, SWITZERLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC. (PMI) (NYSE: PM) STRIVES TO REMAIN AT THE FOREFRONT OF A FAST-EVOLVING ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORTING LANDSCAPE, THE COMPANY TODAY RELEASED ITS FIRST-EVER TCFD REPORT TO RESPOND TO THE IMPLEMENTATION GUIDANCE OF THE TASK FORCE ON CLIMATE-RELATED FINANCIAL DISCLOSURES (TCFD).'}